<title>USA: PHLX, CBOE set new share option listings.</title>
<headline>PHLX, CBOE set new share option listings.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange said it would begin trading options on Knoll Inc on Thursday, August 14, and the Chicago Board Options Exchange said it would begin trading options on Boston Communications Group Inc on Wednesday, August 20.</p>
<p>Knoll options will have opening strikes of 25, 30 and 35, with position limits of 4,500 contracts. Initial expirations will be in September, October, November and February.</p>
<p>TFM Investment Group will be the specialist.</p>
</text>
